# Styling Rules

- Use SCSS modules for component styling.
- Use CSS variables for theme consistency (defined in `src/styles/_variables.scss`).
- **Unit Guidelines:**
  - Use `rem` for values larger than 10px (e.g., font-size, padding, margin, width, height when > 10px)
  - Use `px` for values 10px or smaller (e.g., borders, small gaps, precise positioning)
  - This ensures better scalability and accessibility while maintaining precision for small details
- Prefer class utilities to inline styles.
- Use mixins from `src/styles/_mixins.scss` for reusable patterns (buttons, borders, etc.).
